<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 10.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 10.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to West Norfolk Mar 95.00</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Apr/Jun 98.50</p>
<p>Yorkshire Feb 94.50</p>
<p>Lincolnshire Feb 94.00</p>
<p>Avon range Feb 98.00</p>
<p>Devon Apr/Jun 99.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Feb 97.50</p>
<p>Tilbury Feb 99.00</p>
<p>No business was reported for milling wheat.</p>
</text>
